            "verseId": "GEN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God made the man fall into a deep sleep, and while he was sleeping, he took out one of the man's ribs and closed up the flesh. ",
